WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.906
Unit one. Making Friends!

2
00:00:03.884 --> 00:00:09.674
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:13.321
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:16.971
Today we learn: Making Friends. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:22.489
Acquaintance. Say it with me. Acquaintance!

6
00:00:25.974 --> 00:00:29.074
Bond. Say it with me. Bond!

7
00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:36.384
Trustworthy. Say it with me. Trustworthy!

8
00:00:39.928 --> 00:00:43.345
Loyalty. Say it with me. Loyalty!

9
00:00:46.847 --> 00:00:50.547
Get along. Say it with me. Get along!

10
00:00:53.994 --> 00:00:58.410
Common interest. Say it with me. Common interest!

11
00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:05.508
Reliable. Say it with me. Reliable!

12
00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:12.436
Supportive. Say it with me. Supportive!

13
00:01:15.966 --> 00:01:19.666
Sociable. Say it with me. Sociable!

14
00:01:23.179 --> 00:01:26.946
Introvert. Say it with me. Introvert!

15
00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:33.729
Extrovert. Say it with me. Extrovert!

16
00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:40.696
Connection. Say it with me. Connection!

17
00:01:44.196 --> 00:01:52.925
Grammar time! Relative clauses with who. Listen. A friend who is loyal will support you.

18
00:01:52.975 --> 00:01:58.053
Your turn. Say it with me. A friend who is loyal will support you.

19
00:02:03.169 --> 00:02:10.694
I get along well with people who share a common interest. A trustworthy, loyal friend builds a strong connection over time.

20
00:02:10.744 --> 00:02:12.107
I like this story!

21
00:02:13.353 --> 00:02:18.273
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:18.323 --> 00:02:19.473
Trustworthy!

23
00:02:20.504 --> 00:02:25.564
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:25.614 --> 00:02:26.764
Reliable!

25
00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:35.414
Think and answer. What qualities make someone a good friend?

26
00:02:35.464 --> 00:02:36.614
Great answer!

27
00:02:37.905 --> 00:02:42.897
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:42.947 --> 00:02:44.717
Bye-bye, friends!

